        </div>
        <ul class="bullets" style="margin-top:clamp(.7rem,1.4vw,1.2rem)">
          <li><b>Constraint:</b> inference memory determines deployability on smartphones and edge hardware.</li>
          <li><b>Opportunity:</b> architectural efficiency can beat raw parameter scale.</li>
          <li><b>Goal:</b> retain competitive multimodal accuracy under strict memory budgets.</li>
        </ul>
