      <div class="step"><span class="num">03</span><b>Pixel shuffle</b><span>Space-to-depth compression lowers visual tokens.</span></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="num">04</span><b>Linear projection</b><span>Features enter the language input space.</span></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="num">05</span><b>SmolLM2 backbone</b><span>Visual and text embeddings are concatenated.</span></div>
