        <h1>SmolVLM:<br><span class="serif">small</span> multimodal models, rebalanced</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">A compact VLM family—256M, 500M, and 2.2B parameters—built for resource-efficient inference on mobile and edge devices.</p>
