      <div>
        <h2>Extending context from 2K to 16K unlocks higher-resolution inputs.</h2>
        <p class="subtitle">SmolVLM increases RoPE base from 10K to 273K and fine-tunes on mixed long/short-context data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
