          <div class="context-card"><span>2.2B variant</span><strong>16K</strong><span>largest SmolVLM uses extended context</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="callout" style="margin-top:clamp(.7rem,1.3vw,1.1rem)">Long context and token compression work together: fewer visual tokens make attention overhead manageable.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

